 "_about": "Every number printed on one page of each report, drawn with random.Random(175) from the pages whose text layer has 40 or more numbers. A number is a run of digits with any . or , inside it (common.NUMBER), so .4204 is 4204 and 10^-4 is 10 and 4. Three independent reads were compared: the PDF's own OCR text layer, Tesseract 5, and a transcription by Gemini 4 Argon (not one of the models tested). Where they disagreed we checked the page image; method per page below. For 1083928 (a dot-matrix printout of about 700 numbers) only rows 1-15 of the table and the summary lines below it were keyed by eye, so only recall is scored there.",
